WEBVTT

00:04.170 --> 00:05.080
Well?

00:07.580 --> 00:10.080
What am I doing today?

00:10.080 --> 00:15.170
Lady Komari, today you'll have a meeting
with those executive-level oaficers.

00:15.170 --> 00:17.250
Hey, did you just say "oaficers"?

00:17.250 --> 00:18.920
Don't you mean "officers"?

00:19.460 --> 00:21.750
Now, let's get those clothes changed.

00:21.750 --> 00:23.000
Whoa, hey! Wait!

00:23.000 --> 00:24.380
I don't wanna! Stop! Whoa!

00:24.380 --> 00:25.630
I don't need to take off the panties!

00:26.130 --> 00:29.460
And so, getting stright to the point,
I have a question for you all.

00:29.460 --> 00:31.790
How would you like to proceed from here on?

00:31.790 --> 00:34.920
Fight and a fightin', fight fight fightin'...

00:34.920 --> 00:36.500
Perpetual war.

00:36.500 --> 00:37.710
<b>Lieutenant Bellius Hund Cerbero</b>

00:36.500 --> 00:37.710
<b>Demoted on murder charges</b>

00:38.210 --> 00:40.960
I want to witness Your Excellency's success.

00:40.960 --> 00:42.170
<b>Lieutenant Caostel Conto</b>

00:40.960 --> 00:42.170
<b>Demoted on suspicion of kidnapping a young girl</b>

00:42.420 --> 00:45.130
A rap battle with Your Excellency yo!

00:45.130 --> 00:47.170
Ooh yeah!

00:47.170 --> 00:48.380
<b>Captain Mellanconcey</b>

00:47.170 --> 00:48.380
<b>Demoted on failed attempt to blow up the palace</b>

00:48.540 --> 00:49.880
O-of course...

00:49.880 --> 00:51.880
But for now, you would like
to have war, right?

00:52.040 --> 00:53.750
That is correct.

00:54.710 --> 00:59.580
Now then, we shall continue on to the rewards
from Her Excellency Terakomari.

00:59.580 --> 01:00.420
What?

01:00.420 --> 01:02.880
Her Excellency greatly appreciates

01:02.880 --> 01:06.000
your success in the previous battle
against Lapelico Kingdom,

01:06.000 --> 01:09.080
and she has decided to
repay you for your actions.

01:10.920 --> 01:13.210
Your Excellency is so perfectly photogenic.

01:13.210 --> 01:15.420
But, if I had any say in it, then...

01:15.880 --> 01:18.960
I would increase your variety of clothing!

01:20.500 --> 01:22.670
All right, that's the death penalty!
Death penalty for you!

01:22.670 --> 01:25.830
I do think it suits you extremely well, though.

01:25.830 --> 01:27.670
Just get to dying!

01:28.960 --> 01:33.130
I will... withhold my request for now.

01:34.670 --> 01:35.580
Okay.

01:35.830 --> 01:38.790
Yeah, rap battle!

01:38.790 --> 01:40.210
Yeah!

01:40.460 --> 01:42.540
It's Bloodbath Rapper Mellaconcey,

01:42.540 --> 01:44.670
all my peeps suffer when I sing a high key!

01:44.670 --> 01:46.460
You're the only one vibin'
with my flow so sick,

01:46.460 --> 01:48.790
it's me and you and dead bodies,
all up on our 'fits!

01:48.790 --> 01:49.790
Yeah!

01:49.790 --> 01:51.290
Yo! Yo!

01:51.290 --> 01:53.250
I'm General Komarin,
super strong, can't get no higher!

01:53.250 --> 01:55.130
A wise lil' ruler in this dark empire!

01:55.130 --> 01:57.130
So who's your number one,
who are you fond of?

01:57.130 --> 01:59.000
Just ask anybody, they all get my love!

01:59.000 --> 02:00.330
Yeah!

02:08.790 --> 02:30.750
<b>The Vexations of a Shut-in Vampire Princess</b>

03:37.080 --> 03:42.830
<b>A Sudden Insurrection</b>

03:39.460 --> 03:42.830
The person known as Terakomari Gandesblood

03:43.000 --> 03:45.580
is a tremendous mystery.

03:46.210 --> 03:47.790
And what is that?

03:48.130 --> 03:50.040
A classified document from the imperial court.

03:50.630 --> 03:55.130
The imperial academy raid which caused

03:55.130 --> 03:58.130
an uproar throught the empire
three years ago...

03:58.500 --> 04:00.920
Those details are noted here...

04:00.920 --> 04:03.500
Hey, why do you have something like that?

04:03.790 --> 04:06.420
The culprit in that case is Her Excellency.

04:06.790 --> 04:07.920
What?

04:07.920 --> 04:09.630
According to this part...

04:09.960 --> 04:12.290
There were 30 deaths on the academey's side,

04:12.290 --> 04:16.790
and 70 deaths from the imperial army's
third unit who were sent to take control...

04:17.080 --> 04:19.710
they were all killed with one pinky finger.

04:21.000 --> 04:27.210
By the way, as a child Lady Komari slayed
a hundred vampires with a single pinky finger.

04:27.420 --> 04:31.830
Wait... the culprit in that incident
should be someone else.

04:32.580 --> 04:35.380
The guilty party was switched.

04:35.630 --> 04:39.130
To tell the truth, this part that says
"Terakomari Gandesblood"

04:39.130 --> 04:43.630
is being reported as "Millicent Bluenight"
who has nothing to do with this.

04:44.040 --> 04:45.710
I don't understand.

04:45.710 --> 04:49.000
I don't either, but...

04:49.580 --> 04:51.750
Three years ago, Her Excellency Terakomari

04:51.750 --> 04:56.080
caused a massacre the likes of which
we have never seen before,

04:56.080 --> 04:57.750
is what this means.

05:04.960 --> 05:09.830
Hey, you over there, this place is off-limits
unless you work for the palace.

05:09.830 --> 05:11.500
If you don't want to be killed...

05:11.500 --> 05:14.750
The palace guards are surprisingly steadfast.

05:14.750 --> 05:20.080
I thought I could just go into
the empress' palace and kill her, but...

05:20.080 --> 05:22.960
Thanks to the wall-defense magic,
I couldn't get in.

05:23.250 --> 05:26.380
You... are you trying to take out the empress?

05:26.380 --> 05:28.170
I'll kill her at some point.

05:28.170 --> 05:30.290
But now is not that time.

05:30.290 --> 05:33.380
Oh? Well then, why did you come here?

05:33.380 --> 05:37.250
It's not anything major,
just here to check on things a bit.

05:37.250 --> 05:42.750
I read in the paper that Terakomari Gandesblood
has become a Crimson Lord...

05:43.710 --> 05:45.210
Is that true?

05:47.170 --> 05:49.170
How optimistic to think that magic would work!

06:01.130 --> 06:02.670
Is that all you've got?

06:05.250 --> 06:06.170
Above you!

06:07.580 --> 06:09.330
What are you even looking at?!

06:10.630 --> 06:13.670
None of you can hinder me.

06:13.670 --> 06:16.210
Just learning that made all this worth it.

06:16.460 --> 06:18.670
Give my best to Terakomari, 'kay?

06:18.670 --> 06:19.750
See ya!

06:22.210 --> 06:25.210
She's going after Her Excellency.
What do we do?

06:25.210 --> 06:27.920
There's nothing we can do.

06:28.130 --> 06:31.920
If only I could get a reward coupon for
foot-licking from Her Excellency!

06:31.920 --> 06:35.580
We will move on our own initiative
and handle her!

06:37.170 --> 06:38.420
That sounds good.

06:38.420 --> 06:41.130
You want a coupon for
a foot-licking reward too?!

06:41.130 --> 06:43.960
No! I agree with taking the initiative!

06:49.790 --> 06:52.000
Good morning, Lady Komari.

06:54.420 --> 06:57.210
Oh, it's you Vill. Morning.

06:57.580 --> 06:59.830
But why are you dressed like that?!
It's weird!

06:59.830 --> 07:02.040
You're really good at wearing
embarassing things, huh?!

07:02.040 --> 07:04.380
Do you have any shame at all?!

07:04.790 --> 07:05.960
I do not.

07:05.960 --> 07:08.250
Don't admit to it!
How am I supposed to react to that?!

07:08.420 --> 07:10.420
About today's affairs...

07:10.420 --> 07:14.000
I don't care, tell my subordinates
I'm pretending to be sick.

07:14.000 --> 07:16.630
I feel it would be awkward to tell them
you were feigning illness.

07:17.210 --> 07:19.330
More importantly, are you sure you want that?

07:19.630 --> 07:24.250
You have important plans
to choose your beast today.

07:25.170 --> 07:27.790
Huh?! By beast, you mean THAT beast?!

07:28.170 --> 07:31.250
Now then, Lady Gandesblood.

07:31.500 --> 07:34.670
These are the stables for the beasts.

07:34.670 --> 07:36.380
Wow...

07:36.380 --> 07:39.880
There they are, the beasts!
And there are so many!

07:40.290 --> 07:44.460
To tell the truth, I've kind of longed
for a magical beast!

07:55.880 --> 07:57.170
Come here.

07:57.830 --> 08:00.330
Ah! You can't have that one, Lady Gandesblood!

08:00.330 --> 08:01.250
That one is...

08:01.250 --> 08:03.540
Aww, there you go!

08:05.250 --> 08:07.790
Excuse me, what is that dragon?

08:07.790 --> 08:11.210
That is a mizuchi native to
The Enchanted Lands,

08:11.210 --> 08:11.960
and it is one of the highest classes
among all of the beasts.

08:11.960 --> 08:13.500
That tickles!
and it is one of the highest classes<b>
</b>among all of the beasts.<b></b>

08:13.500 --> 08:15.080
and it is one of the highest classes
among all of the beasts.

08:15.080 --> 08:19.210
But, well, it has a intense preference
for young girls,

08:20.250 --> 08:23.380
and it can't open it's heart to
anyone but a young girl.

08:23.380 --> 08:26.500
I see, that is certainly an explanation
I can understand.

08:26.500 --> 08:27.830
Okay, I've decided!

08:27.830 --> 08:29.960
This one will be my partner!

08:32.250 --> 08:34.080
Now, let's go, Bucephalus!

08:34.080 --> 08:36.080
Let us ride with the wind!

08:48.250 --> 08:51.790
Yo! It's a mock battle but get
blown to smithereens! YEAH!

08:53.830 --> 08:57.080
Tch! Terakomari Gandesblood!

09:03.960 --> 09:06.670
I will get my revenge...
I'll make sure of it!

09:08.670 --> 09:12.250
Outta the way, outta the way, outta the waaay!

09:12.250 --> 09:13.170
Huh?

09:19.580 --> 09:22.330
Stop!

09:28.630 --> 09:32.250
Huh? I'm floating?

09:37.710 --> 09:39.000
Eh?

09:39.540 --> 09:41.330
Oh dear, Lady Komari...

09:41.830 --> 09:46.790
I tell you daily to stop with
the dramatic dismounts, and yet...

09:47.130 --> 09:48.710
Vill...

09:49.500 --> 09:51.790
I'm no' tanking you.

09:51.790 --> 09:54.290
You seem to be tongue-tied.

09:54.290 --> 09:55.790
Sh...shuddup.

09:55.790 --> 09:57.790
Hurry and put me down.

09:57.790 --> 09:59.960
Don't say that. Just a little longer...

09:59.960 --> 10:00.790
Hey...

10:00.790 --> 10:02.080
Controlling a magical beast at that speed
is just as I'd expect from her.

10:02.080 --> 10:04.080
I thought she'd die after falling off but...
Controlling a magical beast at that speed<b>
</b>is just as I'd expect from her.<b></b>

10:04.080 --> 10:06.290
she's got some serious guts.

10:06.290 --> 10:08.330
J-jus' pu' me down.

10:08.330 --> 10:09.500
Right away.

10:09.500 --> 10:11.630
My goodness!

10:11.630 --> 10:13.330
Is that you, Your Excellency?

10:13.330 --> 10:15.290
A pleasure to see you.

10:15.290 --> 10:18.080
Caostel, how you doin'?

10:18.080 --> 10:20.540
I am doing wonderfully, thank you.

10:20.540 --> 10:24.580
Every member of the Komari unit
is giving their all in training.

10:25.000 --> 10:27.920
Oh? I'm please ta hear dat.

10:27.920 --> 10:31.580
Yes, please take part in the exercises as well,
Your Excellency, by all means!

10:32.500 --> 10:36.630
What're you sayin'? If I take par'
ev'yone will die o' my sickness.

10:36.630 --> 10:41.630
Certainly, that simpleton died
before challenging you to a battle.

10:41.630 --> 10:42.580
Huh?

10:45.080 --> 10:49.670
That piece of refuse was run over
and killed by your mount.

10:49.920 --> 10:52.330
Long live Her Excellency!

10:52.330 --> 10:53.670
Long live murderers!

10:53.670 --> 10:55.380
Purge all traitors!

10:56.920 --> 10:59.540
I'm not dead yet you boneheads!

11:00.500 --> 11:04.580
Die, little girl!

11:06.580 --> 11:08.170
Oh... I'm gonna d-

11:09.630 --> 11:11.000
She dodged?!

11:12.080 --> 11:13.040
Eh?!

11:13.040 --> 11:16.380
Whaaaat?!

11:17.920 --> 11:20.170
Wow, what poise!

11:20.170 --> 11:23.290
Her Excellency is magnificent.
It's as if she's a matador!

11:24.080 --> 11:26.170
I'm dizzy...

11:26.170 --> 11:27.460
Damn it!

11:30.290 --> 11:33.540
Move outta the way!

11:36.630 --> 11:38.330
My eyes! My eyes!

11:38.580 --> 11:40.460
S-sorry...

11:40.460 --> 11:41.460
Lady Komari!

11:41.460 --> 11:43.670
Let's hit him hard right here.

11:45.420 --> 11:48.210
This is what happens when you defy me!

11:48.460 --> 11:51.920
Next time, I'll gouge out your eyeballs
and those other balls too,

11:51.920 --> 11:56.250
so make sure you're ready for that!

11:56.250 --> 11:59.080
Y-you little...

12:00.040 --> 12:03.460
You really got me good...

12:03.880 --> 12:06.080
You'll pay for this!

12:07.710 --> 12:10.290
Terakomari Gandesblood!

12:10.290 --> 12:13.540
I challenge you to a duel!

12:26.380 --> 12:28.210
A duel?

12:37.330 --> 12:44.460
Komarin! Komarin! Komarin!

12:44.460 --> 12:47.750
Your Excellency!
Beat the hell out of that loser!

12:48.040 --> 12:50.170
Koma-tan is so great!

12:50.710 --> 12:53.000
Lady Komari, can you hear me?

12:53.000 --> 12:54.880
How is it going?

12:55.130 --> 12:57.630
Obviously extremely crappily!

12:57.920 --> 13:01.210
You can do it, this is where
you must stand firm.

13:01.580 --> 13:04.210
Vill, can I...

13:04.210 --> 13:06.500
Can I survive this and go home?

13:06.500 --> 13:07.920
Have you forgotten?

13:07.920 --> 13:10.830
Just because you're killed
does not mean you'll die.

13:10.830 --> 13:15.290
I know that! But it hurts!
And it's hot! And I'll suffer!

13:15.920 --> 13:17.500
Please relax.

13:17.880 --> 13:23.710
As long as I am here, it is completely
unlikely that you will die in a duel.

13:24.920 --> 13:27.210
Leave it all to me.

13:27.540 --> 13:31.670
I will bring the glory of victory to you.

13:33.170 --> 13:34.250
Really?

13:43.130 --> 13:45.630
T-Terakomari...

13:46.170 --> 13:51.830
T-today I will make sure you b-burn!

13:54.080 --> 13:56.460
I filled his meal with poison.

13:56.460 --> 13:58.080
You did this?!

14:00.210 --> 14:02.460
What's wrong, Your Excellency?

14:02.460 --> 14:05.920
Gonna burn, burn, burn you all up...

14:07.130 --> 14:09.670
G-gonna send you to the hospital.

14:09.670 --> 14:11.960
You're the one who should go to the hospital!

14:11.960 --> 14:13.290
The hell you say?!

14:13.290 --> 14:15.290
G-g-gonna murder...

14:17.670 --> 14:19.080
What do I do about this?!

14:19.080 --> 14:22.130
This is like a horror movie
that's unsuitable for kids!

14:22.130 --> 14:23.130
Hey Vill!

14:23.130 --> 14:25.790
Okay, Lady Komari. Use magic.

14:25.790 --> 14:26.790
What?!

14:26.790 --> 14:29.630
If I could do something like that
I wouldn't be struggling right now!

14:29.630 --> 14:32.250
No, just act like you're using it.

14:32.250 --> 14:37.040
On my signal, snap your fingers like you're
making a big show of it for everyone.

14:37.040 --> 14:37.920
Huh?!

14:37.920 --> 14:38.960
Here we go.

14:39.290 --> 14:42.210
3, 2, 1...

14:42.210 --> 14:43.250
Okay, now!

14:50.210 --> 14:51.830
What was that magic?

14:51.830 --> 14:54.250
She opened a hole under
her opponent's feet from that far?!

14:54.250 --> 14:57.830
That's the advanced magic skill
"Kingdom Crumbler."

14:57.830 --> 15:01.790
But I couldn't feel the slightest
flow of magical power...

15:01.790 --> 15:06.080
In short, this means Her Excellency can
also use power-concealing magic skills.

15:07.630 --> 15:11.250
Ah yes, the advanced magic skill
"Lacquered Wings," huh?

15:09.250 --> 15:11.250
<b>Lacquered Wings</b>

15:11.380 --> 15:12.080
Wow! Your Excellency is so mighty!

15:12.080 --> 15:14.290
What was that?
Wow! Your Excellency is so mighty!<b></b>

15:14.290 --> 15:17.040
I dug a pit last night.
Amazing, Your Excellency!<b></b>

15:17.040 --> 15:18.670
How is that possible?!

15:18.670 --> 15:23.330
By the way, this arena is set up
with pits in 52 places.

15:23.330 --> 15:26.540
Absolutely do not move, Lady Komari.

15:29.630 --> 15:32.000
You call that magic?

15:32.250 --> 15:36.130
I'm not playing around, you damn fraud!

15:37.630 --> 15:39.830
Hey Vill, where are the pits?

15:39.830 --> 15:43.040
Unfortunately, there are no pits
on the straight line

15:43.040 --> 15:45.330
connecting you and Lieutenant Helders.

15:45.330 --> 15:47.630
Why not? You dug a ton of them, right?!

15:47.630 --> 15:50.710
I can only attribute this to bad luck.

15:53.460 --> 15:55.040
Burn!

15:55.040 --> 15:56.380
Hey, time out, time out!

15:56.380 --> 15:59.210
Vill, can't we do something
with the snap again?!

15:59.210 --> 16:00.960
No, it's too late for that.

16:00.960 --> 16:02.540
Whaddaya mean too late?!

16:02.540 --> 16:04.330
Like my life is over?! You've gotta be-

16:07.290 --> 16:08.630
Landmines.

16:08.830 --> 16:09.920
Eh?

16:10.580 --> 16:12.170
L-landmines?

16:12.540 --> 16:16.080
Last night, I buried about 69 of them.

16:16.080 --> 16:18.500
You didn't think this plan through very well...

16:18.500 --> 16:21.790
Now Lieutenant Helders has
safely met his maker.

16:21.790 --> 16:23.210
You have won, Lady Komari.

16:23.210 --> 16:24.920
Uh, yeah, I guess...

16:27.080 --> 16:29.920
Now you've done it...

16:30.250 --> 16:33.130
I'm gonna catch you,

16:33.130 --> 16:35.040
burn your clothes off,

16:35.040 --> 16:38.000
and make you do the fire dance naked...

16:45.540 --> 16:47.330
Huh? He's dead?

16:47.790 --> 16:50.000
Lady Komari, declare your victory.

16:50.330 --> 16:51.670
R-right...

16:52.040 --> 16:53.250
Sorry.

16:57.040 --> 16:59.040
The rebel is dealt with!

16:59.040 --> 17:02.460
Yeah!

17:02.790 --> 17:05.000
Oh, oh yeah! Oh!

17:05.000 --> 17:07.630
Komarin! Komarin! Komarin!

17:07.960 --> 17:13.000
Say Vill, I feel like I'm deceiving everyone.

17:13.000 --> 17:16.750
It isn't just a feeling, you actually
are deceiving everyone.

17:25.790 --> 17:30.420
I thought I was gonna die...

17:33.080 --> 17:36.460
Maybe I should thank her too.

17:36.460 --> 17:39.880
I want you to express that with your body
and not your words if at all possible,

17:39.880 --> 17:42.540
so may I proceed to embrace you?

17:46.710 --> 17:49.880
S-stop it, you're such a perverted maid!
Now, Lady Komari, you must<b>
</b>prepare to bathe with me.<b></b>

17:49.880 --> 17:50.960
Now, Lady Komari, you must
prepare to bathe with me.

17:50.960 --> 17:53.330
Wait! Don't massage me there!

17:53.330 --> 17:56.330
And you're hurt, aren't you?!

17:57.170 --> 17:59.080
I only have blisters.

17:59.080 --> 18:02.080
Tomorrow they will be magically healed.

18:02.080 --> 18:03.670
Tell me about your injury.

18:04.830 --> 18:06.080
I can't.

18:06.080 --> 18:08.330
Then this is an order, tell me about it.

18:17.540 --> 18:21.040
There were pits there to kill
Yohann Helders, right?

18:21.040 --> 18:22.040
Yeah.

18:22.040 --> 18:23.790
I dug them all with a shovel.

18:23.790 --> 18:26.080
You did that manually?!

18:26.080 --> 18:28.830
Deadly poison is the only magic I can use.

18:28.830 --> 18:30.040
I-I see...

18:30.420 --> 18:34.170
I apologize for showing you
something so unsightly.

18:34.170 --> 18:35.960
It's not unsightly at all!

18:36.460 --> 18:39.290
You worked really hard for my sake, Vill.

18:39.290 --> 18:43.960
If you weren't there, I'd be dead right now.

18:45.000 --> 18:49.170
I'm, well... grateful to you for that.

18:50.540 --> 18:55.380
So... don't try to hide the injuries
you suffered for my sake.

18:55.880 --> 19:01.540
I mean, I should share that
sort of injury with you.

19:01.540 --> 19:02.920
So...

19:02.920 --> 19:06.380
In any case, thank you.

19:07.750 --> 19:11.670
That's what I mean, do you get it?

19:13.710 --> 19:15.130
I do.

19:15.460 --> 19:17.080
Huh? You do?

19:17.580 --> 19:21.920
I understand that Lady Komari loves me.

19:24.080 --> 19:25.920
Well, whatever.

19:26.880 --> 19:28.380
But let me ask you...

19:28.380 --> 19:31.380
Why do you cling to me so much?

19:31.380 --> 19:32.790
It's a little creepy.

19:32.790 --> 19:36.380
Because you have a beauty that only
comes around once every million years.

19:36.380 --> 19:39.880
Well I know that.
But that's not what I mean.

19:39.880 --> 19:44.170
I'm curious if there's some other,
more special reason.

19:48.250 --> 19:51.580
I've commited a crime.

19:55.290 --> 19:56.920
I know that too.

20:00.040 --> 20:02.920
You sexually harass me like crazy.

20:17.380 --> 20:18.670
Damn it!

20:19.000 --> 20:21.500
Damn you, Terakomari Gandesblood!

20:21.500 --> 20:23.420
You loathe her that much?

20:24.540 --> 20:26.790
That little girl?

20:28.210 --> 20:32.630
You're Lieutenant Helders of
the imperial army, right?

20:32.630 --> 20:34.130
Who are you?

20:34.710 --> 20:36.710
I'm Millicent...

20:37.790 --> 20:40.630
of the sublime Inverse Moon.

20:42.290 --> 20:43.710
Say.

20:43.710 --> 20:46.920
Want to do business with me?

20:49.580 --> 20:52.500
An invitation to that
perverted Empress's party?

20:52.500 --> 20:56.790
Yes. She said it's to congratulate you
for your success and the like.

20:56.790 --> 21:01.250
Huh. Will I get paid overtime,
or have a make-up holiday or...

21:01.790 --> 21:06.000
Your Excellency, what should we do?

21:06.000 --> 21:07.130
You also...

21:07.130 --> 21:10.380
Er, I mean, do you dislike this sort of thing?

21:10.380 --> 21:12.380
To be frank, yes.

21:12.380 --> 21:16.210
I have come to live a life that has
no relation to the upper class.

21:17.630 --> 21:20.380
No need to be so down on yourself.

21:20.380 --> 21:22.670
There's no doubt that your military
achievements as a member of

21:22.670 --> 21:25.830
the imperial army are the results
of your hard work.

21:25.830 --> 21:28.040
That's something to be proud of, Bellius.

21:28.040 --> 21:29.830
Y-Your Excellency...

21:29.830 --> 21:32.670
Welcome, Sweet Komari!

21:32.670 --> 21:34.170
Are you enjoying yourself?

21:34.710 --> 21:37.330
Oh, stop. Today's festivities are informal.

21:38.330 --> 21:42.920
Komari, We wouldn't mind you
calling Us "Ren-chan," not at all!

21:44.250 --> 21:47.790
By the bye, Komari, how is your job
as a Crimson Lord going?

21:47.790 --> 21:49.420
Like I can tell you that.

21:50.630 --> 21:52.460
No need to ask, eh?

21:52.790 --> 21:55.500
In the short time since you've
taken up your post,

21:55.500 --> 21:58.670
you've defeated four other nations
excluding The Enchanted Lands,

21:58.670 --> 22:01.000
I've never seen a Crimson Lord quite like you.

22:01.000 --> 22:04.080
I was just lucky, no other explanation for it.

22:04.460 --> 22:07.630
This is a party to celebrate your achievements.

22:07.630 --> 22:11.170
Oh, here, how do you like
the 100% blood juice?

22:12.130 --> 22:15.130
Ah, you don't like blood.

22:20.790 --> 22:24.080
Actually, We are feeling relieved.

22:24.460 --> 22:27.790
Three years ago you were
shut away in your room,

22:27.790 --> 22:31.790
and it must have been difficult
to re-enter society like that,

22:31.790 --> 22:34.580
but looks like your father's gamble
was a success.

22:34.580 --> 22:35.790
Gamble?

22:36.210 --> 22:41.880
Yes, he bet that you would leave your room
if you were forced to be a Crimson Lord.

22:41.880 --> 22:43.000
Huh?!

22:43.630 --> 22:47.080
Komari, you aren't alone anymore.

22:47.080 --> 22:50.750
You have subordinates you can rely on,
and Komarists all through the empire...

22:51.330 --> 22:54.830
Just like Us, there are plenty of people
that love you dearly,

22:55.380 --> 22:59.880
so no matter what happens, don't fall into
despair like you did three years ago.

23:01.290 --> 23:03.750
Well then, enjoy the party!

23:12.290 --> 23:13.710
Terakomari.

23:18.080 --> 23:21.250
Mind having a chat with me too?

25:07.170 --> 25:11.000
<b>The Darkness of the Shut-in Vampire Princess</b>

25:08.080 --> 25:10.500
"The Darkness of the Shut-in Vampire Princess."
